# Verification

- Use `.cursor/skills/verify-app/SKILL.md` when validating product behavior: Launch → Doctor → Drive → Evidence → Cleanup.
- Maintain feature maps under `.cursor/skills/verify-app/features/`. Index: `features/README.md`.
- pstack: `/create-verification-skill` scaffolds; `/maintain-verification-skill` updates maps/skills and **must not edit product code**.
- Attach evidence to PRs (see `.github/PULL_REQUEST_TEMPLATE.md`).
- Cloud/factory agents should reuse the **same** verify skill as local — do not invent a weaker cloud path.
- If verification cannot run, say blocked and why; do not silently substitute "unit tests passed."
